=== DIVERGENCE PATTERN ===

PRIMARY: zenjxl AC strategy search allocates ~588 MORE first-blocks to
PARTIAL strategies (IDENTITY, DCT2X2, DCT4X4, DCT4X8, DCT8X4, AFV0-3) that
EARLY-RETURN from AdjustQuantBlockAC. cjxl's AC strategy search at e9 d=4
on this photo-class image keeps all first-blocks on non-partial kinds.

Per OUR_STRAT_NAME counts (last-iter, Y channel):
| strategy   | cjxl_n | zen_n | delta |
|---         |---     |---    |---    |
| DCT8       | 503    | 518   | +15   |
| DCT16X8    | 208    | 205   | -3    |
| DCT8X16    | 318    | 318   | 0     |
